    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To estimate our projected margin on this contract, our need to consider the total budget allocated by The client's, which is 3 million euros over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our can secure the total budget allocated by the client, which is 3 million euros over 4 years for our, and considering our projected margin on this contract, our projected revenue would be a portion of the 3 million euros that allows our to achieve our projected margin on this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without knowing the exact costs associated with delivering this contract, our cannot directly calculate our projected margin on this contract from the given information." ;
