    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "That being said, if our were to hypothetically secure a contract valued at or near The client's budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, and assuming our costs are such that our can achieve our projected margin on this contract, then our projected margin on this contract would be 28 percent of our revenue." ;
