        ex:hasText "Proposed architecture: the solution will be based on a cloud-native architecture using EU-based cloud providers like OVHcloud or Scaleway, ensuring sovereignty and compliance with regulatory requirements. our will design a microservices-based system with API integration using REST, GraphQL, or SOAP protocols, depending on the client's existing systems. a microservices-based system with API integration will be secured with encryption, authentication, and secrets management mechanisms." ;
