        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can adhere to the cross-border transfer policy of prohibiting transfers outside EU unless there's an explicit legal basis, which aligns with GDPR requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explicability and transparency of recommendations or proposals issued by the solution, we can utilize we AI security controls, such as output PII redaction and model update security review." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, explicability of AI decisions might require additional capabilities not explicitly mentioned in we current context, so require could be a potential gap." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure a high level of security, we can enforce multi-factor authentication (MFA) using TOTP or hardware tokens (FIDO2), and utilize Privileged Access Management (PAM) solutions like CyberArk Conjur or HashiCorp Vault. we network security architecture patterns include Zero-trust, micro-segmentation, and defence-in-depth, which are robust. we also have experience with DDoS mitigation and conduct annual penetration testing plus post-major release testing, with the last pentest showing two medium findings that were remediated." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The local authority emphasis on data sovereignty, we should ensure all data hosting and processing occur within EU, leveraging we experience with SecNumCloud projects (we have worked on three such projects)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will help in maintaining data sovereignty and adhering to the no-transfer rule outside EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Encryption and anonymization of sensitive data where applicable can be achieved using tools like Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) for anonymization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Potential risks or gaps include ensuring explicability of AI-driven decisions, which might require additional tools or methodologies not currently outlined in we capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another potential gap could be in demonstrating strict compliance with all regulatory requirements beyond GDPR, such as the EU AI Act and NIS2 Directive, although we have experience with the EU AI Act and NIS2 Directive." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Continuous monitoring and improvement of we security posture will be crucial to address any emerging risks or gaps, especially considering the evolving nature of regulatory requirements and cybersecurity threats." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with regulatory requirements in force, including GDPR, and explicability and transparency of recommendations or proposals issued by the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client also expects that no decision will be automated without explicit validation of an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with regulatory requirements in force, including GDPR?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have expertise in EU AI Act, awareness of prohibited AI practices, and knowledge of limited risk AI transparency obligations, as well as human oversight contractual enforcement. we also have a no automated decision without human validation policy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

